<!doctype html><html lang="ru"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#090b18"><title>ARES GLOBAL PAYMENTS</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% -20%,#30215c,transparent 45%),#080a16;color:#f5f6ff;font-family:Arial,system-ui}.wrap{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:22px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}.brand{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px}.logo{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#38bdf8);margin-right:10px}.pill,.notice{border:1px solid #30385d;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px;color:#aeb6d5;font-size:13px}.hero{text-align:center;padding:55px 0 32px}.eyebrow{color:#bca8ff;letter-spacing:4px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold}h1{font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,62px);line-height:1.04;margin:14px 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#b9a5ff,#83dcff);color:transparent;background-clip:text}.hero p{color:#aeb6d5;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6}.notice{max-width:700px;margin:22px auto 0;background:#11162b}.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin:28px 0 15px;gap:12px}.head span,.muted{color:#9da6c8;font-size:13px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}.card,.panel{background:linear-gradient(155deg,#171d39,#101428);border:1px solid #293052;border-radius:19px;padding:19px}.card{min-height:265px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 9px 24px #05071355}.card:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto;height:7px;background:var(--pack)}.card.best{border-color:#ffd45c;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #ffd45c55,0 15px 30px #05071366}.gem{width:100%;height:102px;border-radius:15px;background:var(--pack-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;font-size:37px;margin:0 0 15px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.gem span{filter:drop-shadow(0 5px 3px #0005);transform:rotate(-8deg)}.gem span:nth-child(2){font-size:50px;transform:translateY(-5px) rotate(8deg)}.gem span:nth-child(3){font-size:29px;transform:translateY(9px) rotate(16deg)}.amount{font-size:27px;font-weight:900}.muted{margin-top:4px}.price{font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:13px 0 11px}.tag{position:absolute;right:12px;top:16px;background:#ffd45c;color:#45320a;border-radius:20px;padding:6px 9px;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;z-index:1}.pack-note{font-size:11px;color:#bfc8e8;margin-top:5px}.card button{background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--pack),var(--pack-dark));color:#17203b;box-shadow:0 5px 14px #0003}button{border:0;border-radius:11px;padding:13px 15px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#8b5cf6,#397ce8);color:white;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}.card button{margin-top:auto}.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:15px;margin:22px 0 35px}.panel h3{margin-top:0}.line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #28304e;color:#aeb6d5}.line b{color:#fff}.actions{display:flex;gap:9px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{flex:1}.secondary{background:#202747;border:1px solid #354064}.note{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da6c8}footer{border-top:1px solid #293052;padding:20px 0;color:#858eaf;font-size:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}@media(max-width:800px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:480px){.wrap{padding:15px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding-top:35px}.head{display:block}}
</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><header class="top"><div class="brand"><span class="logo">A</span>ARES <span style="color:#a18bff">GLOBAL</span><div style="font-size:10px;color:#9da6c8;letter-spacing:4px;margin-left:54px">PAYMENTS</div></div><div class="pill">◆ ARES STORE · DEMO</div></header>
<section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">OFFICIAL GAME CURRENCY STORE</div><h1>Пополняй баланс.<br>Играй на максимум.</h1><p>Выбирай набор Gems для ARES GAME. Удобный магазин игровой валюты в едином стиле вселенной ARES.</p><div class="notice">Демонстрационная версия. Реальные платежи пока не подключены — тестовый заказ не списывает деньги.</div></section>
